   "title": "How DEEP is it, and does it need a knife as well as antibiotics?",
   "lines": [
    "pus in a closed space, a joint or dead bone → drain or debride",
    "septic arthritis: see ACUTE MONOARTHRITIS · viral polyarthritis: parvovirus B19, hepatitis B, C, HIV"
   ]
  },
